240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1614373/2fdfdc52-f896-4d22-9214-00d62e6ae6bc.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1614373/2fdfdc52-f896-4d22-9214-00d62e6ae6bc.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1614373/2fdfdc52-f896-4d22-9214-00d62e6ae6bc.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Relax in this stylish apartment (formerly \"Wohnträumerei\"). In addition to mountain views and idyllic tranquility, enjoy other highlights:\n\n→ Fully equipped kitchen\n→ Spacious living room with dining area for 6\n→ Flexible beds (2 90cm single beds or 180cm double beds) + pull-out daybed (160cm) + sofa bed\n→ Nintendo Switch + 4 controllers\n→ Zattoo HD 55-inch TV\n→ Washing machine\n\nHere you're far from the hustle and bustle, yet close to the center. Perfect for hiking enthusiasts and large groups!\n\nThe large skylights create an impressive sense of space and bathe the entire accommodation in bright light. The heart of the apartment is the spacious living, dining, and lounge area:\n→ Cozy dining area for 6 people\n→ 55\" Smart TV + streaming\n→ Nintendo Switch with 4 controllers + game selection\n→ Comfortable pull-out sofa bed + daybed for 2 people each\n→ Work area with mountain views\n→ Small selection of board games\n\nFully equipped kitchen:\n→ Large fridge-freezer combination\n→ Oven, microwave, kettle, toaster, etc.\n→ Dishwasher\n→ Nespresso and filter coffee machine\n→ Basic supplies of salt, pepper, oil, etc.\n→ Welcome pack with a small selection of coffee and tea\n\nBedroom:\n→ High-quality flexible beds (2 90cm single beds or 180cm double beds), can be joined or separated as needed\n→ Large open wardrobe\n→ Fold-out baby bed with extra Hauk mattress\n→ Bed linen included\n\nSecond sleeping area in the living room\n→ Fold-out sofa bed with slatted frame and mattress for 2 people\n→ Pull-out daybed (160 cm)\n\nBathroom:\n→ Spacious bathroom with natural light and bathtub including shower\n→ Washing machine\n→ Hairdryer, towels, shower gel, shampoo, and conditioner\n\nBad Berleburg invites you to hike, bike, ski, or simply explore the beautiful surroundings and nature. A highlight is Sayn-Wittgenstein Castle, which offers regular guided tours or a museum tour. You are surrounded by numerous parks, as well as inviting restaurants and cafés. The Rothaarbad spa with its wellness area is just a few minutes from the accommodation. The Wisent Hut is particularly recommended as a starting point for exploring the bison wilderness, as is a trip to the numerous hiking trails of the Rothaarsteig. Winterberg can be reached in just 20 minutes. A bus stop is just a 2-minute walk away, with direct connections to the city center as well as to Bad Laasphe, Siegen and Winterberg.\n\nA two-minute walk from the accommodation, there are several daily bus connections to the center of Bad Berleburg, as well as to Siegen and Bad Laasphe. The train station is a five-minute drive or about a 20-minute walk away. From there, there are regular direct buses to Winterberg. The Kurhessenbahn takes you to Marburg via Bad Laasphe and Biedenkopf in just two hours.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"shared"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"v